# UI Copy Minimalism

Err on the side of silence. Structure teaches; captions that restate the route, format, or mechanic are deleted.

- No meta-explanations ("Separate from the daily Rapid Fire streak", how probes "unlock scenario facts", grounding tutorials).
- No redundant labels (restamping "Case Files" under Cases, format badges next to a format-obvious title).
- No decorative icon + echo rows (icon beside a title already shown as the hero).
- Prefer short verbs: Begin, Lock probes, Commit, Next, Finish.
- Keep state labels that change (Probes · 2 / 3); drop narrative section headers (Recommendation, Unlocked scenario facts).
- Score copy stays numeric.

Canonical detail: `design.md` §7. Domain term: UI Copy Minimalism in `CONTEXT.md` / `GLOSSARY.md`.
